                         "version":  1,
                         "originalText":  "A. Factory \u0026 Pipeline Scopes\n\n* Global Parameters: Factory-wide constants\n  Syntax: @pipeline().globalParameters.env\n  Use: Base URLs, alert emails, enterprise tags\n\n* Pipeline Parameters: Injected on trigger/run\n  Syntax: @pipeline().parameters.p_watermark\n  Use: Execution dates, batch IDs, environment",
                         "x":  55,
                         "fontFamily":  3,
                         "verticalAlign":  "top",
                         "updated":  1,
                         "opacity":  100,
                         "text":  "A. Factory \u0026 Pipeline Scopes\n\n* Global Parameters: Factory-wide constants\n  Syntax: @pipeline().globalParameters.env\n  Use: Base URLs, alert emails, enterprise tags\n\n* Pipeline Parameters: Injected on trigger/run\n  Syntax: @pipeline().parameters.p_watermark\n  Use: Execution dates, batch IDs, environment",
