                         "seed":  89733,
                         "version":  1,
                         "originalText":  "B. Pipeline Variables \u0026 System Metadata\n\n* Pipeline Variables: Internal mutable state\n  Syntax: @variables(\u0027v_loop_counter\u0027)\n  Modified via: \u0027Set Variable\u0027 or \u0027Append Variable\u0027\n\n* System Variables (Runtime Injected):\n  @pipeline().TriggerTime    (ISO timestamp)\n  @pipeline().DataFactory    (ADF factory name)\n  @pipeline().RunId          (Unique GUID)\n  @item()                    (Inside ForEach iterator)",
                         "x":  55,
                         "fontFamily":  3,
                         "verticalAlign":  "top",
                         "updated":  1,
                         "opacity":  100,
                         "text":  "B. Pipeline Variables \u0026 System Metadata\n\n* Pipeline Variables: Internal mutable state\n  Syntax: @variables(\u0027v_loop_counter\u0027)\n  Modified via: \u0027Set Variable\u0027 or \u0027Append Variable\u0027\n\n* System Variables (Runtime Injected):\n  @pipeline().TriggerTime    (ISO timestamp)\n  @pipeline().DataFactory    (ADF factory name)\n  @pipeline().RunId          (Unique GUID)\n  @item()                    (Inside ForEach iterator)",
