                         "seed":  98279,
                         "version":  1,
                         "originalText":  "C. Inter-Activity Dynamic Output Passing\n\nActivity A passes runtime outputs to Activity B:\n* Lookup / Web Activity Output:\n  @activity(\u0027act_get_watermark\u0027).output.firstRow.last_sync_date\n  @activity(\u0027act_lookup_tables\u0027).output.value (Array for ForEach)\n\n* Execution Status Checks:\n  @activity(\u0027act_copy_step\u0027).status  (e.g., \u0027Succeeded\u0027)\n  @activity(\u0027act_copy_step\u0027).output.dataRead\n  @activity(\u0027act_copy_step\u0027).output.rowsCopied",
                         "x":  55,
                         "fontFamily":  3,
                         "verticalAlign":  "top",
                         "updated":  1,
                         "opacity":  100,
                         "text":  "C. Inter-Activity Dynamic Output Passing\n\nActivity A passes runtime outputs to Activity B:\n* Lookup / Web Activity Output:\n  @activity(\u0027act_get_watermark\u0027).output.firstRow.last_sync_date\n  @activity(\u0027act_lookup_tables\u0027).output.value (Array for ForEach)\n\n* Execution Status Checks:\n  @activity(\u0027act_copy_step\u0027).status  (e.g., \u0027Succeeded\u0027)\n  @activity(\u0027act_copy_step\u0027).output.dataRead\n  @activity(\u0027act_copy_step\u0027).output.rowsCopied",
