                         "seed":  98154,
                         "version":  1,
                         "originalText":  "D. Dynamic Datasets \u0026 Linked Services\n\nAvoid creating hundreds of static datasets/connectors!\n\n1. Define Parameters on Dataset:\n   @dataset().folder_name  |  @dataset().file_name\n   Activity passes: ds_params = { folder_name: \u0027bronze\u0027 }\n\n2. Define Parameters on Linked Service:\n   @linkedService().server_host | @linkedService().keyvault_url\n   Dataset passes: ls_params = { server_host: \u0027neon.tech\u0027 }\n\nPassing Chain:\nPipeline Expression -\u003e Dataset Parameter -\u003e Linked Service Param",
                         "x":  55,
                         "fontFamily":  3,
                         "verticalAlign":  "top",
                         "updated":  1,
                         "opacity":  100,
                         "text":  "D. Dynamic Datasets \u0026 Linked Services\n\nAvoid creating hundreds of static datasets/connectors!\n\n1. Define Parameters on Dataset:\n   @dataset().folder_name  |  @dataset().file_name\n   Activity passes: ds_params = { folder_name: \u0027bronze\u0027 }\n\n2. Define Parameters on Linked Service:\n   @linkedService().server_host | @linkedService().keyvault_url\n   Dataset passes: ls_params = { server_host: \u0027neon.tech\u0027 }\n\nPassing Chain:\nPipeline Expression -\u003e Dataset Parameter -\u003e Linked Service Param",
