                         "originalText":  "C. Returning Values from Databricks to ADF\n\n1. In Databricks Notebook (Exit Statement):\nimport json\nmetrics = {\"rows_inserted\": 14500, \"status\": \"COMPLETED\"}\ndbutils.notebook.exit(json.dumps(metrics))\n\n2. In ADF Subsequent Activities (e.g., Set Variable / If):\n@activity(\u0027act_run_databricks\u0027).output.runOutput\n@json(activity(\u0027act_run_databricks\u0027).output.runOutput).rows_inserted\n@equals(json(activity(\u0027...\u0027).output.runOutput).status, \u0027COMPLETED\u0027)",
                         "x":  585,
                         "fontFamily":  3,
                         "verticalAlign":  "top",
                         "updated":  1,
                         "opacity":  100,
                         "text":  "C. Returning Values from Databricks to ADF\n\n1. In Databricks Notebook (Exit Statement):\nimport json\nmetrics = {\"rows_inserted\": 14500, \"status\": \"COMPLETED\"}\ndbutils.notebook.exit(json.dumps(metrics))\n\n2. In ADF Subsequent Activities (e.g., Set Variable / If):\n@activity(\u0027act_run_databricks\u0027).output.runOutput\n@json(activity(\u0027act_run_databricks\u0027).output.runOutput).rows_inserted\n@equals(json(activity(\u0027...\u0027).output.runOutput).status, \u0027COMPLETED\u0027)",
