                         "originalText":  "D. Databricks Python Activity (Script / Wheel)\n\nADF passes positional CLI arguments:\n\"pythonParameters\": [\n  \"@{pipeline().parameters.p_env}\",\n  \"@{pipeline().RunId}\"\n]\n\nPython Script Reads via sys.argv:\nimport sys\nenv, run_id = sys.argv[1], sys.argv[2]",
