                         "version":  1,
                         "originalText":  "A. The 4 Databricks Widget Types\n\n1. Text Widget:\n   dbutils.widgets.text(\u0027date\u0027, \u00272026-10-27\u0027, \u0027Date\u0027)\n2. Dropdown Widget (Single Pick):\n   dbutils.widgets.dropdown(\u0027env\u0027, \u0027dev\u0027, [\u0027dev\u0027,\u0027qa\u0027,\u0027prod\u0027], \u0027Env\u0027)\n3. Combobox Widget (Dropdown + Free text edit):\n   dbutils.widgets.combobox(\u0027region\u0027, \u0027eastus2\u0027, [\u0027eastus2\u0027,\u0027westus\u0027], \u0027Loc\u0027)\n4. Multiselect Widget (Multiple choices):\n   dbutils.widgets.multiselect(\u0027tables\u0027, \u0027dim_cust\u0027, [\u0027dim_cust\u0027,\u0027dim_part\u0027])\n   val_list = dbutils.widgets.get(\u0027tables\u0027).split(\u0027,\u0027)",
                         "x":  1115,
                         "fontFamily":  3,
                         "verticalAlign":  "top",
                         "updated":  1,
                         "opacity":  100,
                         "text":  "A. The 4 Databricks Widget Types\n\n1. Text Widget:\n   dbutils.widgets.text(\u0027date\u0027, \u00272026-10-27\u0027, \u0027Date\u0027)\n2. Dropdown Widget (Single Pick):\n   dbutils.widgets.dropdown(\u0027env\u0027, \u0027dev\u0027, [\u0027dev\u0027,\u0027qa\u0027,\u0027prod\u0027], \u0027Env\u0027)\n3. Combobox Widget (Dropdown + Free text edit):\n   dbutils.widgets.combobox(\u0027region\u0027, \u0027eastus2\u0027, [\u0027eastus2\u0027,\u0027westus\u0027], \u0027Loc\u0027)\n4. Multiselect Widget (Multiple choices):\n   dbutils.widgets.multiselect(\u0027tables\u0027, \u0027dim_cust\u0027, [\u0027dim_cust\u0027,\u0027dim_part\u0027])\n   val_list = dbutils.widgets.get(\u0027tables\u0027).split(\u0027,\u0027)",
