                         "seed":  90536,
                         "version":  1,
                         "originalText":  "B. Databricks Workflows Task-to-Task Passing\n\nModern Workflows pass dynamic parameters between tasks:\n\n1. Upstream Task (Silver):\n   dbutils.jobs.taskValues.set(key=\u0027bronze_batch_id\u0027, value=9821)\n   dbutils.jobs.taskValues.set(key=\u0027record_count\u0027, value=450000)\n\n2. Downstream Task (Gold):\n   batch_id = dbutils.jobs.taskValues.get(\n       taskKey=\u0027silver_transform\u0027, key=\u0027bronze_batch_id\u0027, default=0\n   )\n\n3. In Workflow UI: {{tasks.silver_transform.values.record_count}}",
                         "x":  1115,
                         "fontFamily":  3,
                         "verticalAlign":  "top",
                         "updated":  1,
                         "opacity":  100,
                         "text":  "B. Databricks Workflows Task-to-Task Passing\n\nModern Workflows pass dynamic parameters between tasks:\n\n1. Upstream Task (Silver):\n   dbutils.jobs.taskValues.set(key=\u0027bronze_batch_id\u0027, value=9821)\n   dbutils.jobs.taskValues.set(key=\u0027record_count\u0027, value=450000)\n\n2. Downstream Task (Gold):\n   batch_id = dbutils.jobs.taskValues.get(\n       taskKey=\u0027silver_transform\u0027, key=\u0027bronze_batch_id\u0027, default=0\n   )\n\n3. In Workflow UI: {{tasks.silver_transform.values.record_count}}",
                         "strokeStyle":  "solid",
